tree-sitter-typescript 0.23.2 vendor

Base source: https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript/tree/v0.23.2
Base commit: f975a621f4e7f532fe322e13c4f79495e0a7b2e7
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

Local grammar patch provenance:
https://github.com/jhanssen/tree-sitter-typescript/commit/1b3e602cd4021dd390ecdeb72ae8e37bbca402e8

Only the import-in-type-position portion of that commit is applied in
common/define-grammar.js:
- remove the special import member/call aliases from `type`;
- add those aliases to `primary_type`, making them reachable through
  `index_type_query` and other type operators;
- permit the aliased import member expression as a `generic_type` name.

The unrelated accessor-modifier changes from 1b3e602 are intentionally not
included.

The JSX grammar is also patched so JSX element, namespace, and attribute
names accept JavaScript/TypeScript reserved words as IdentifierName values
without relaxing ordinary identifier parsing. The TSX-only conflict entries
in common/define-grammar.js keep type-parameter and type-member ambiguity
explicit and leave the TypeScript dialect branch unchanged.

The generated TypeScript and TSX parser sources, node-type tables, and
matching tree-sitter support headers were regenerated from this narrowed
grammar with tree-sitter CLI 0.25.10 using ABI 14, with
tree-sitter-javascript 0.23.1 as the grammar base.
